WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.497
Lephas Company Limited. Transforming the future.

00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:12.316
Lephas is a software company, founded in 2026, built around its clients.

00:00:12.316 --> 00:00:17.502
We design, build, and support the technology that moves your business forward.

00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:25.788
Business websites. Online stores. Mobile apps. Point-of-sale systems. And the APIs that connect them.

00:00:25.788 --> 00:00:34.902
Bring us a whole project, or hire one of our developers directly — the flexibility of an individual, with the accountability of a company.

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:37.167
Here is what we stand for.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:44.139
Plain communication. No jargon. You always know what we are doing, why, and what it costs.

00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:51.448
Quality you can rely on. Tested code, secure systems, and sites that load fast on any phone.

00:00:51.448 --> 00:00:57.503
Partnership. We stay with you after launch, and grow your product as your business grows.

00:00:57.503 --> 00:01:04.808
And transforming the future — helping businesses use technology to serve more customers, and work smarter.

00:01:04.808 --> 00:01:12.535
From your first idea, to launch day, and beyond — a team that keeps you informed every step of the way.

00:01:12.535 --> 00:01:19.615
Lephas Company Limited. Let's build what moves your business forward.
